    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "E49EDFBA7377DED8",
      "text": "Je te suis reconnaissant de m’avoir invité\\nen ces lieux, [VAR 0x0100(0000)] ![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "E49EE0BA7377E08B",
      "text": "Cela ne pouvait pas mieux tomber, car je viens de\\nterminer ma dernière œuvre, et je compte bien\\r\\nprofiter de ma venue pour me reposer un peu.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "E49EE1BA7377E23E",
      "text": "Cela étant dit, je constate que, quelle que soit\\nla région, les jeunes arborent le même regard\\r\\naffligé qui les caractérise...[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 128,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "E49EE2BA7377E3F1",
      "text": "Mais ce dôme... Quelle splendeur !!!\\c\\nL’harmonie ineffable entre tous ces biotopes si\\ndifférents ! Rien de tel pour exalter la créativité ![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "A0B376FEFB2B9812",
      "text": "Vous m’en voyez ravi[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "A0B375FEFB2B965F",
      "text": "L’harmonie... quoi ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "E49EE4BA7377E757",
      "text": "Que mon émoi soit une source de bonheur\\npour toi est une heureuse coïncidence ![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp01_05b",
      "hash64": "F1E5DDD234BDDF0F",
      "text": "Splendide ! L’union de ces biotopes est tellement\\nparfaite que les mots manquent pour la décrire ![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "E49EE3BA7377E5A4",
      "text": "Où en étais-je... ? Ah oui, le dôme !\\c\\nJ’aimerais tant monter sur cette mystérieuse\\ncréation suspendue au plafond...\\c\\nLa vue qu’elle offre doit être incomparable ![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 118,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 167,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "BA20E9C5BCE09F87",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)] ! J’ai à te parler ![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "BA20E8C5BCE09DD4",
      "text": "Savais-tu qu’Unys est la région d’origine\\nd’un célèbre artiste ?[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "78872684BFFF3133",
      "text": "Évidemment !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "78872784BFFF32E6",
      "text": "Non, je l’ignorais.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "BA20E4C5BCE09708",
      "text": "Ta culture artistique est proche de l’érudition !\\nSon art t’est familier, mais laisse-moi t’expliquer\\r\\nce qui rend son travail unique pour moi...[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 147,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp02_05b",
      "hash64": "267C25FFF1A1491E",
      "text": "Je vois ! Laisse-moi donc te présenter le travail\\nde ce remarquable individu ![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "BA20EBC5BCE0A2ED",
      "text": "Ses œuvres, dont le raffinement n’a d’égal que\\nla profondeur, ont toutes pour inspiration\\r\\nles Pokémon de type Insecte.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "BA20EAC5BCE0A13A",
      "text": "Je suis très intrigué par les grandes similarités\\ncréatives entre nous.\\c\\nComme moi, il utilise l’art pour sublimer\\nle type de certains Pokémon...[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 147,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "BA20E5C5BCE098BB",
      "text": "Il paraît qu’il a un atelier à Volucité...\\nEt si j’y passais sur le chemin du retour... ?[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "11CD13CD595FC5B6",
      "text": "Te rappelles-tu de cet artiste à Volucité, dont\\nnous avons discuté précédemment ?\\c\\nFigure-toi que je me suis rendu à son atelier...[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "11CD14CD595FC769",
      "text": "Quel endroit avant-gardiste !!![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "11CD11CD595FC250",
      "text": "Il y avait des sculptures servant d’ascenseurs qui\\nétaient faites entièrement en fils de soie, comme\\r\\nsi elle avaient été tissées par un Tissenboule ![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 152,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "11CD12CD595FC403",
      "text": "J’ai utilisé les ascenseurs encore et encore, juste\\npour le plaisir d’interagir avec cette œuvre...[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "11CD18CD595FCE35",
      "text": "Petit à petit, je me suis retrouvé recouvert de fils,\\ndevenant ainsi un véritable cocon humain.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp03_06",
      "hash64": "11CD15CD595FC91C",
      "text": "Eh oui... Sans m’en rendre compte, j’ai fini\\npar ne faire plus qu’un avec l’œuvre...\\r\\nQuel bouleversement ![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "EB651E4CF38C48F8",
      "text": "C’est digne des plus grandes « toiles » !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "EB65214CF38C4E11",
      "text": "J’ai du mal à visualiser...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp03_07",
      "hash64": "11CD16CD595FCACF",
      "text": "Je savais que tu saisirais la force d’un tel instant,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)] ! Tu es bel et bien digne\\r\\nde devenir un jour l’un[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e de mes disciples ![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
